      "widgets_values": [
        "**Experimental. YMMV.** Judged by eye, on one seed, by one person, on an RTX 4090 at 1344x768 and 345 frames. Those renders also ran Sol-Attn (sparse attention from ComfyUI-h3-explorations), which this graph does not.\n\n## FlashGen alone (reference to video), maybe crap\n\nFlashGen's 4 steps on the ref2va checkpoint, with FlashGen converted for ref2va's time basis. Same prompt and references as the ref2va PDD8 workflow.\n\nWhy: an untested transfer. FlashGen was trained for text to video only. One render held both references and the likeness by eye; it has not been compared against PDD8."
      ]
